title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf gui input
catalog: CLI command
target: mf gui input
summary: Wait for one of the given keys and print it

!! Reference

```
Wait for one of the given keys and print it

Usage: mf gui input [OPTIONS] <KEYS>...

Arguments:
  <KEYS>...
          Keys to bind for the duration of the wait (e.g. y n q). The GUI keeps `escape`, `tab` and `:` for the user and refuses a wait asking for one of them

Options:
      --prompt <PROMPT>
          Question shown in the GUI's dedicated input bar while waiting (kept separate from status/error messages)

      --timeout-ms <TIMEOUT_MS>
          

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
